    <item>
      <title>封面与正文图片</title>
      <link>https://gumezm.github.io/blog/posts/2026/08/15/cover-and-image/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://gumezm.github.io/blog/posts/2026/08/15/cover-and-image/</guid>
      <description>封面缩略图与正文图片的尺寸/懒加载处理。</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>列表页的封面会裁剪为 480×240 的缩略图；正文图片则会带上
<code>width</code> / <code>height</code> / <code>loading</code> / <code>decoding</code> 属性，减少布局偏移。</p>
<p><img alt="示例图片" decoding="async" height="630" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 768px, 1024px" src="/blog/posts/2026/08/15/cover-and-image/cover-3.png" srcset="/blog/posts/2026/08/15/cover-and-image/cover-3_hu_273e91e6d94ded10.png 384w, /blog/posts/2026/08/15/cover-and-image/cover-3_hu_238f8ea6898fe6d0.png 768w, /blog/posts/2026/08/15/cover-and-image/cover-3_hu_5da2e776625eafc4.png 1024w" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1.9048;" width="1200"></p>
]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
